[
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:0.1", "PA_cp_22:0.2"], "en": "The Basket of Conduct (Cariyāpiṭaka), Chapter on Yudhañjaya:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:0.3"], "en": "The Perfection of Renunciation (Nekkhammapāramī) 2", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:0.4"], "en": "Somanassacariya: “Furthermore,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:1.1"], "en": "when I was in Indapatta,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:1.2"], "en": "that most excellent city;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:1.3"], "en": "The beloved son,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:1.4"], "en": "known as Somanassa,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:2.1"], "en": "was virtuous and endowed with excellent qualities.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:2.2"], "en": "Possessing auspicious eloquence,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:2.3"], "en": "honoring the elders, modest,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:2.4"], "en": "and skilled in the means of integration.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:3.1", "PA_cp_22:3.2"], "en": "There was a fraudulent ascetic who was a counterpart to that king;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:3.3"], "en": "[he planted] a grove and flowering shrubs.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:3.4"], "en": "Having planted it, he lives on.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:4.1"], "en": "Having seen that deceiver,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:4.2"], "en": "who is like a heap of chaff without rice, I [despise him].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:4.3"], "en": "Like a hollow tree trunk within,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:4.4"], "en": "like a plantain tree without pith—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:5.1"], "en": "therein is no essence of the virtuous.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:5.2"], "en": "This man has fallen away from his status as a recluse;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:5.3", "PA_cp_22:5.4"], "en": "having abandoned shame and the bright qualities of the Dhamma, he does so for the sake of maintaining his livelihood.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:6.1", "PA_cp_22:6.2"], "en": "The border region was bought back from the wilderness and from foreign lands;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:6.3"], "en": "going there to suppress it, he—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:6.4"], "en": "My father instructed me thus:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:7.1"], "en": "“Do not neglect, my dear son,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:7.2"], "en": "the matted-hair ascetic of fierce austerities.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:7.3"], "en": "\"He grants all desires at will;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:7.4", "PA_cp_22:8.1"], "en": "therefore, having gone there, I shall attend upon him.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:8.2"], "en": "I spoke these words:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:8.3"], "en": "“Householder, I hope you are well;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:8.4"], "en": "what would you like to be brought to you?”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:9.1"], "en": "Because of that, he was angry,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:9.2"], "en": "a deceiver relying on pride:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:9.3"], "en": "\"I shall have you killed today!\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:9.4"], "en": "\"Or shall I banish him from the kingdom?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:10.1"], "en": "Having quelled the border region,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:10.2"], "en": "the king spoke to the rogue:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:10.3"], "en": "‘Venerable sir, I hope you are bearing up;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:10.4"], "en": "I trust your hospitality has been well-received.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:11.1"], "en": "To him, the wicked one explains:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:11.2"], "en": "Like a prince, he was not to be harmed;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:11.3"], "en": "having heard those words of his,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:11.4"], "en": "the lord of the earth gave the command.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:12.1", "PA_cp_22:12.2"], "en": "“Having cut off his head right there and divided it into four pieces,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:12.3"], "en": "you should display them from street to street.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:12.4", "PA_cp_22:13.1"], "en": "That state is despised by those with matted hair. There, the executioners go—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:13.2"], "en": "cruel, fierce, and merciless.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:13.3"], "en": "As I sat on my mother’s lap,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:13.4"], "en": "they dragged me away;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:14.1"], "en": "to them I spoke thus:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:14.2", "PA_cp_22:14.3"], "en": "\"Bind me with firm bonds and show me quickly to the king;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:14.4"], "en": "I have royal business to attend to.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:15.1"], "en": "They showed me to the king,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:15.2"], "en": "a sinner who associates with evil;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:15.3"], "en": "having seen me, he instructed me.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:15.4"], "en": "And he brought me under his control.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:16.1", "PA_cp_22:16.2"], "en": "There he asked my forgiveness and gave me the great kingdom.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:16.3"], "en": "Thus, having shattered that darkness,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:16.4"], "en": "I went forth into the homeless life.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:17.1"], "en": "This great kingship was not to be given by me.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:17.2"], "en": "\"Sensual enjoyment is not to be desired;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:17.3"], "en": "omniscience is dear to me,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:17.4"], "en": "therefore I have renounced the kingdom.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_22:18.1"], "en": "The practice of joy is the second.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"}
]
